/T (SEET \(Support Education, Empower Together\) was founded to close the persistent gap between the aspirations of refugee students in Switzerland and their actual access to higher education. Although universities increasingly open pathways, many refugee learners remain excluded due to structural, cultural, and financial barriers.)
/E (SEET \(Support Education, Empower Together\) was founded to close the persistent gap between the aspirations of refugee students in Switzerland and their actual access to higher education. Although universities increasingly open pathways, many refugee learners remain excluded due to structural, cultural, and financial barriers.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
