/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (Achievement of Personal Goals: Ten mentees \(48%\) achieved all goals outlined in their mentoring agreement, while eleven \(52%\) achieved some of them. Not a single participant reported not achieving any of their goals. These outcomes confirm the effectiveness of our mentoring agreements as a tool for supporting progress. These results demonstrate how SEET tailors its programme to individual objectives.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
